    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/820620/extras/fc95e4eaf21698ecfdb298c4be522324.avif?t=1613870529\" /></div><br><br>Spooky Ghosts Dot Com is a small metroidvania about a ghost hunter named Ruby.  One Halloween night a ghost hunting job comes in, but it turns out to not be a regular gig!<br><br>Features:<br><br>-5 different interconnected spooky areas to fight through.<br>-50+ rooms to explore!<br>-6 spooky bosses to defeat.<br>-Find and pet all 8 lost cats!<br>-Items to boost Rubys power and gain new abilities!<br>-Ghost buddies, cats, shopkeepers, and others to meet within the mansion.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/820620/extras/e77bf201da9459e1f519543d208a53a0.avif?t=1613870529\" /></div>",
